# Opt-in diagnostic filter for allocations whose stack contains Fontconfig.
# The default sanitized test preset does not use this file.
# A minimal Cairo/Pango probe retained a fixed allocation total after either
# one draw or 2,000 draws, but that does not explain all application reports.
# This filter can also hide application-caused leaks allocated by Fontconfig.
# Keep unsuppressed logs and use raw repeated-workload measurements when
# investigating font ownership or growth. Do not treat a filtered pass as
# evidence that every font allocation is a harmless cache.
leak:libfontconfig.so
